! CDE's font names (-dt-interface, -dt-application), for CDE and Motif
! clients whose host's own fonts.alias the display can't see: the names
! CDE uses, mapped to the B&H Lucida families as CDE maps them. Written for
! vintrdp (see scripts/x11/bundle-fonts.py); not from X.org.
